# Brand Assets

The images, logos, and icons in this directory are the brand assets of
**Kestrel**, maintained by LocknAlert Pty Ltd, and are released under the same
MIT License as the rest of this repository.

They are generated from a single definition in
`scripts/generate_brand_assets.py`. Edit the mark there and regenerate rather
than editing these files individually, so the SVG and the raster icons cannot
drift apart.

## They are not Frigate's

These assets replace the originals. The Frigate logo is a separate visual
trademark of Frigate, Inc. which a fork may not redistribute, so it has been
removed from this repository entirely — see `TRADEMARK.md` section 5 and
`NOTICE.md`.
